flowchart TD
  A[Authenticated upload] --> B{CSRF and user quota valid?}
  B -->|No| Reject[Reject safely]
  B -->|Yes| C{Admission and file size valid?}
  C -->|No| Reject
  C -->|Yes| D[Worker checks MIME and active content]
  D --> E{Safe within resource bounds?}
  E -->|No| Reject
  E -->|Yes| F[Private file plus transactional metadata]
  F --> G[ValidationEngine with server-owned VIZE or FINAL policy]
  G --> H{Required checks pass?}
  H -->|No| I[Report required problems; admin may request correction]
  H -->|Yes| J[UNDER_REVIEW]
  J --> K[Admin compares original and saves manual checks]
  K --> L{Current comparison reviewed and required policy checks pass?}
  L -->|No| J
  L -->|Yes| M[APPROVED]
  M --> N[Revalidate and complete]
  N --> O[COMPLETED locked for student]
  O -->|Admin reason and version| U[Privileged correction returns UNDER_REVIEW]
  U --> J
  O -->|Admin confirmed soft delete| S[Normal access closed; audit retained]
